OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy to start, with isolated
OL,6,Fshowers. Cloud breaks developing and
OL,7,Fshowers tending to ease to leave an
OL,8,Foften dry afternoon with some bright
OL,9,Fintervals. A brisk breeze persisting
OL,10,Faround the coast. Temperatures near
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FVariable cloud could give an
OL,14,Fisolated shower, although often dry.
OL,15,FPatchy hill fog on the higher Pennine
OL,16,Fsummits. Chilly where any cloud breaks
OL,17,Fpersist but generally frost-free.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
