OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FVariable, often large
OL,6,Famounts of cloud, still with isolated
OL,7,Fshowers possible but also some bright
OL,8,Fintervals. A gentle easterly breeze
OL,9,Fwith temperatures around normal for
OL,10,Fthe time of year.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FHigh
OL,13,Fpressure continues to dominate, often
OL,14,Fbringing cloudy conditions with a few
OL,15,Fshowers, and a gentle easterly breeze.
OL,16,FTemperatures remain around normal for
OL,17,Fthe time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
